'''Mount Izukika''' was a [[Water|snowy]] [[mountain]] on the [[planet]] [[Kijimi]]. The ancient [[Kijimi City]] and [[Kijimi Spaceport|Kijimi City spaceport]] were located high atop Mount Izukika, between other surrounding mountains. During the [[New Republic Era]], the young [[human]] [[Karr Nuq Sin]] and [[droid]] [[RZ-7]] landed the [[yacht]] ''[[Avadora]]'' on Mount Izukika to [[Fuel|refuel]] in the [[city]].<ref name="Force Collector" /> [[Granite|Granitic]] rock was quarried from Mount Izukika and used to construct Kijimi City's streets and buildings.<ref name="TROSVD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref>

{{Nature-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Mount Izukika first appeared in the young adult novel ''[[Force Collector]]'', which was written by [[Kevin Shinick]] and published in [[2019]].<ref name="Force Collector" />

